 L2.\n1436:**L5 — end to end.** Files: `test/yin/repl/dht_process_test.clj`, new\n1453:- The store corpus (an export reading a module-level definition) evaluates\n1462:  its acceptance gate is L2's zero-fetch link.\n1480:- **Step 5a for module-level reads in the tree formats.** Which modules\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
